# Design

Tokens live in `src/styles/tokens.css`: `--bg #F7F5F0`, `--surface #FFFFFF`, `--line #E4E0D6`, `--ink #1A1A17`, `--ink-muted #6B675E`, `--primary #0E3A5B`, `--accent #9A7B4F`, `--available #2F5D46`, `--sold #7A2E2A`.

- Radius 2–4px. Spacing on a 4px scale. Table row height 32px.
- Geist = UI. Geist Mono = unit codes. Newsreader = headings and big numbers only.
- Numbers: `tabular-nums`, right-aligned. PKR via `formatPkr` / `formatPkrLedger` (lakh/crore).
- Motion 150–200ms ease-out only.
- Icons only in navigation.

Banned: gradients, shadows, card boxes, emoji, rainbow colours, purple, Lucide, Recharts, default shadcn styling. Use hairline `border-line` dividers instead of cards.
